{"id":"raide","lemma":"raide","pos":"adj","rank":3855,"glosses":["stiff, straight","steep, abrupt","stubborn"],"ipa":"/ʁɛd/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2a/Fr-raide.ogg/Fr-raide.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"raides"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon dos est raide.","en":"My back is stiff.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"back"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Elle est raide dingue de lui.","en":"She's completely crazy about him.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"mad, crazy, nuts"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"him, he, it"}]},{"text":"Je me suis senti un peu raide.","en":"I felt a little stiff.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"to smell","l":"sentir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"Elle est bonne à tomber raide.","en":"She's drop-dead gorgeous.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to fall"},null]},{"text":"Les chaussures sont raides quand elles sont neuves.","en":"Shoes are stiff when they are new.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"shoe","l":"chaussure"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"brand new, very new","l":"neuf"}]}]}